>>
Rule 1 (input must be 1-D and integral dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ (dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5)
>>
Rule 2 (input values are non-negative or input is empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (shape(v_1, 0) = 0) ∨ (min(v_1) ≥ 0)
>>
Rule 4 (weights should be 1-d and have the same length as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_1, 0)
>>
Rule 5 (minlength should be non-negative)
{v_3 : int} |= v_3 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 6 (input must not be Double (float64))
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 8
